    scenario:['A late vendor task threatens a customer deadline','A required vendor file is overdue. The project tool says work is on track, but the vendor email contains no delivery confirmation and a downstream team cannot begin without the file.','The assistant verifies the conflicting records, contacts the vendor using the approved follow up, updates the blocker field with source links, and asks the operations owner to choose the customer and priority response.','The review checks source accuracy, escalation timing, preservation of the original commitment, and whether the procedure now explains how to handle conflicting status evidence.'],
